    <statement><p>Match each vector field with its graph.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F} = \frac{-y\vec{i} + x\vec{j}}{x^2+y^2}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F} = \vec{i}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F} = -y\vec{i} + x\vec{j}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F} = x\vec{i} + y\vec{j}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F} = \frac{x\vec{i} + y\vec{j} + z\vec{k}}{(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F} = x\vec{i} + y\vec{j} + z\vec{k}</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
<p>.
<CENTER/></p>
